	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050130"},
		line=1010,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I sit down to face Akari-sama, backdropped by the setting sun.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How may I be of assistance?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wanted to ask you a question.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When you examined my body earlier, you said you found a source of hidden magicks, right?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you think you could unseal it?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe it would be possible, yes.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, as I am sure you remember, the last time we attempted such a thing, it ended rather poorly.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Back then, I heard the Founding Empress's voice...”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Akari-sama pauses, narrowing her eyes thoughtfully.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"She seems to have an idea in mind.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So do you think if we unseal these magicks, we could draw out the Founding Empress's power?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is difficult to say.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do at least believe that these magicks are related to the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But unsealing them could very well have untoward effects on your own person.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What sort of effects?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Under normal circumstances, two consciousnesses cannot inhabit the same body.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You might imagine it as two individuals fighting over the same chair. Logic dictates that the weaker of the two would be pushed aside.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I hesitate to even suggest this... but in the worst case, it is possible that your consciousness could cease to be.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“After all, the Founding Empress is the greatest priestess ever known to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Akari-sama's lips form a thin line.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"She does not betray a single flicker of consternation.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"If anything, her silence attests to the fact that she had likely long since considered this possibility.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hate to burden you any more than I already have, but...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“P-Please, take some time and reconside─”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've already made up my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, unseal the magicks inside me.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I had a terrible sense of foreboding the moment I saw the look in Akari-sama's eyes as I entered the room.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Was it our reminiscences of Satonaka-sama that served to harden her resolve?",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've pledged my life to seeing the Empire restored.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To serve the greater good, I'm more than willing to relinquish my body to the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But if you were to disappear, there would be no purpose in restoring the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There would. The indignities of the Imperial people deserve to be repaid, even if it means sacrificing myself.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please treat yourself with more care!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're one to talk after trying to give up your life for Soujin like that.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-Well...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your Highness's life is a thousand times more valuable than the likes of mine...”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ko-to-ne?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyah!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"I flinch beneath her withering glare.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"S-Still, I must find a way to stop Akari-sama.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“D-Didn't you instruct me not to use my magicks anymore...?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll make an exception.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You monster!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You would sacrifice my life just to fulfill your selfish ends?!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I always knew the Lord of Mount Momiji was a tyrant!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Call me a monster all you want.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Akari-sama replies smoothly.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Ooh, what am I to do?",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Listen, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You of all people should get where I'm coming from, right?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You were willing to lay down your life to serve as Soujin's bride, weren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In order to restore the Empire, I'm willing to lay down mine.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're the same, you and I.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Akari-sama shows me a gentle smile, the smile of someone\nwho's fully made peace with herself.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It took me a while, but I understand now how you must have felt going into that ritual.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So I'll stop telling you not to use your magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But in exchange, won't you be my accomplice? There's nothing you have to feel guilty about.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah... Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"This is bad. How am I ever to turn her down?",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"I am absolutely no match for her.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"She extends a firm hand towards me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"It's a gesture containing all the infinite mercy and uncompromising resolve of a true Empress.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"As the Exalt-Priestess, as a faithful subject of the Empire, there is nothing I wish more than to take her hand.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"And yet, and yet─",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Precisely because she is such a wonderful person, I refuse to allow her to come to harm.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"There is still much, much more that I can do before she need risk her own life.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I refuse.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I understand your desire to show off your resolve, but I will not stand for it.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This isn't about showing off.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You said it yourself: no more magicks. And no take backsies!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold it, Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I may not seem it, but I can be as stubborn as they come.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hrmph, hrmph! Harrumph!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"With a million apologies in my heart, I play the part of an obstinate child.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Listen here, you!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You just want to show off to Soujin-sama, is that it?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you even saying?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm only thinking about the good of the Empi─”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Argh, forget it!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Akari-sama stomps out of the room.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aaaauuughh, what have I done...?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I collapse into a heap on the floor.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Now I've really gone and done it... But I still believe it was the right thing to do.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Akari-sama wishes desperately to be of service to Soujin-sama, however she can.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
{"font", size=49},
"The regrets of her fallen comrades, the hopes of the Imperial people, the future of the Empire─it's only natural that she would lose her composure, carrying all that weight on her shoulders.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"I understand your desperation all too well, Akari-sama.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"So please, wait just one night, that I might first do all that I can.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am every bit as resolved as you are, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Shiinoha Kotone may not look the part, but she ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" still\nMitsurugi's bride.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"According to Soujin-sama's dream, all the Exalt-Priestesses of the past offered themselves, body and soul, to Mitsurugi-sama.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"If so, then it is clear what I must do.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Even if it were not my duty, though, I am still fully resolved to go through with it.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... Prepare yourself for a certain bridey ≪something.≫”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Unable to fall asleep, I leave my room to wander about the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Since priests and priestesses are early to bed and early to rise, not a soul is to be found.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Yet in that moment, I notice a light coming from the ceremony hall.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"There Kotone sits, all alone.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're still awake?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why, Soujin-sama, what brings you here at this hour?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Kotone peers up at me from the scrolls she's poring over.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just couldn't get to sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, did I interrupt you?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, not at all. In fact, your timing could not be more perfect.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawawa─I did not mean to say that part aloud!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"What in the world is she on about?",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"At Kotone's strangely flustered insistence, the two of us return back to my room.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you have some business with me?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-That... I do.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Kotone meekly nods her head.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As it happens, I have a most important request I would entreat of you.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anything, as long as I can do it.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It should be... N-No, it absolutely must be! It would be most troubling if you were unable to...”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would be for the sake of reclaiming your power and fulfilling Akari-sama's great ambitions.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then I swear to do everything I can.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"I reply, leaning eagerly forward, only for Kotone to shrink slowly away from me.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Um, you see...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Still refusing to meet my eyes, Kotone timidly begins to disrobe.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Her immaculate skin is flushed bright pink in the dim, lamplit darkness.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is, a certain bridey...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A certain what?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What I mean to say is that I intend to offer you my body, right here and now!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Kotone's voice echoes in my ears, over and over again.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't understand.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is to say, umm... engage in certain conjugal relations...”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Or rather, for you to take this body of mine into your possession, and with it─”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I understood that much.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Then please do not make me spell it all out!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Kotone's face flushes even redder in exasperation.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The first Exalt-Priestess said that her role was to serve as\nMitsurugi's bride, did she not?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And the first thing any bride must offer unto her betrothed is her own body.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thus, I intend to offer Mitsurugi-sama, which is to say... y-you, m-my─!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Kotone's cheeks are bright red, and her brow is slick with sweat.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"She must be mustering up all the courage she has.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we consummate our relation, I'll be able to obtain power like Mitsurugi's?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I believe there is a possibility.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How can you ask me to defile your body without solid proof?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is very much still worth a try.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you would refuse me, then please, claim my life instead.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you partake of my blood, it may also restore your power.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You bestowed me your power in precisely such a manner, did you not?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Kotone presses me for a response.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should treat your own life with more respect.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ever since the first, we Exalt-Priestesses have unfailingly dedicated our lives in service to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We willingly offer our lives in order to forge spellblades, and even Mitsurugi-sama would not exist if not for the sacrifice of eight hundred and eighty-eight devoted souls.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Just as warriors stake their lives on their blades, we priestesses stake our lives on our magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Asking me to cherish my life is akin to asking a warrior to forsake the battlefield!”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're not thinking straight.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, it is you, sir, who needs to think straight!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you do not reclaim Mitsurugi-sama's power, we cannot hope to stand against the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We must attempt absolutely everything in our power.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If I were to preserve my life at the cost of betraying my devotion, I would surely regret it until the day I died.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Would that be your idea of treating my life with respect?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I'm unable to say anything in response.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"That which you live for is that which you are willing to die for.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"It is just as she says─warriors and priestesses are the same.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"And her resolve is as firm as that of any warrior.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you truly care for the future of the Empire, Soujin-sama, please claim my body as your own.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Just as you would cut down all those who stand athwart your path, I ask you to avail yourself of all those who may be of service to you.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Kotone fixes me with an imploring gaze filled with resolution.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Reason is on her side.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"We stand right now on a blade's edge.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"As soon as the Republican Army gets a whiff of Inner\nIseya's location, a battle will be inevitable.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"And with me in my current condition, we could not hope to prevail.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Kotone is right─we need to be trying everything in our power.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"If there's the slightest chance of reclaiming Mitsurugi's power, I shouldn't be hesitating to use her body, or even to claim her life.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"It's what she wishes for, even.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"But... for some reason, I'm unable to take that final step.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"And the reason for that is simple─",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			select={
				"Her suggestion isn't going to work.",
				"I can't bear to hurt Kotone needlessly.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, I don't think what you're suggesting is going to work.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-Whyever not?!”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If it's to restore the Empire, I shouldn't be hesitating.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case─”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But still, I refuse.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How can you justify that?!”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Akari is my lord, and her orders are absolute.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"But my decision here is mine alone to make─",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't bear to hurt you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes widen at my declaration.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-What... do you mean by...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're someone very precious to me.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"My next words render her speechless.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Her round eyes grow wider and wider, even as they slowly well up and flow over with tears.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“S-Such sentiments are far more than I could ever deserve...”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am naught but an imposter, a mere shadow of my predecessors...”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your station has nothing to do with this.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Exalt-Priestess or not, I don't want to hurt you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I refuse to be the sort of man who'd treat his bride so carelessly.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Our faces close enough to touch, the two of us stare into each other's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"If not for the tears rolling down her cheeks, I'd think time itself had frozen still.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Her limpid eyes reflect back at me a man wearing such a tender, gentle expression that I almost don't recognize him.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I'm terribly sorry... P-Please excuse my indecency.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Kotone frantically wipes away her tears with the sleeve of her kimono.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Immediately after, she gives her head several good shakes, as though to calm herself down.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Words cannot describe how overjoyed I am that you cherish me so.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But still, my intentions have not changed.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There is another reason why I cannot lay with you.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In all my recollections of Mitsurugi's memories, never once did he come to know any of his Exalt-Priestesses intimately.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Likewise, not once did he ever take their lives to restore his power.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's as I said before. Mitsurugi recovered his power through magicks administered by the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, the dream I saw had no recollections of that sort.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Looks like she remembers.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If there was some purpose in laying together, the Exalt-Priestesses of the past would have done so as well.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh... I do believe you have a point...”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Kotone despondently hangs her head.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Reaching over, I give her head a few gentle pats.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think about it this way: you'll always be my bride, even without needing to offer me your body.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We don't have much time left, so I'm counting on you to find another way, all right?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, what a wonderful man you truly are.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You may count on me.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I will do everything in my power to find another way.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"The anxiety on Kotone's face slowly melts away.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am terribly sorry for only thinking of myself.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You have nothing to apologize for.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If anything, I think your resolve is well worthy of respect.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"There is nothing more beautiful than a heart filled with steadfast resolve.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"I could never look down on Kotone for what she did.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Umm, if I might raise one final matter... I would greatly appreciate it if you might be so kind as to keep what transpired tonight a secret from Akari-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I promise.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"It'll save Kotone a lecture from Akari about treating her life with more respect.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Phew, that is a great relief.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case, Soujin-sama, I shall retire for the night.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I'll get some sleep, too.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"I've stayed up awfully late.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am happy I was able to talk to you.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Good night to you, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
		next={ block=178, label=3 },
		exit={ block=207, label=1 },
	},
}
